{"unit_id":"dshworks__dsh-meter#card-zh","repo":"dshworks/dsh-meter","commit":"7865bd6533d2703b0d9b46c57aee3c339d4b121e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-meter 是面向 DSH Web 的 DeepSeek 用量与峰谷价仪表：它把会话日志中的模型、token 数和请求时段按公开费率折算，在输入框下显示会话估算费用、当前费率及切换倒计时，并提供可悬停或聚焦打开的明细卡片和 Meter 设置页。明细按输入缓存命中、未命中和输出拆分费用，展示账户余额、费率表与一周时段图；可选 saving mode 会在系统提示中加入当前费率建议。余额通过主机端接口按需读取，费率来自内置价目表；安装无需额外配置，读取余额时可使用 DeepSeek API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:66-115","lib/core.js:663-727","src/ui.js:641-710"]}
{"unit_id":"dshworks__dsh-meter#card-en","repo":"dshworks/dsh-meter","commit":"7865bd6533d2703b0d9b46c57aee3c339d4b121e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-meter adds a DeepSeek cost meter to DSH Web. It estimates session charges from tokens and dispatch-time rates, showing cost, tariff, and countdown below the composer. A detail card breaks down usage and balance; settings show rates. Saving mode can add tariff guidance to the system prompt.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:66-115","lib/core.js:663-727","src/ui.js:641-710"]}
