{"unit_id":"dshworks__dsh-meter#feature-1","repo":"dshworks/dsh-meter","commit":"7865bd6533d2703b0d9b46c57aee3c339d4b121e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-meter 的功能「按峰谷价估算会话费用」：读取会话中的模型与 token 用量，按请求发起时的费率、币种和缓存命中类别折算估算费用；同一步后续补充的用量会替换先前样本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/core.js:663-727","lib/core.js:792-845"]}
{"unit_id":"dshworks__dsh-meter#feature-2","repo":"dshworks/dsh-meter","commit":"7865bd6533d2703b0d9b46c57aee3c339d4b121e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-meter 的功能「输入框下的费率倒计时」：会话产生计费请求后，在 Web 输入框下显示费用、当前峰谷状态和下次切换倒计时；悬停或键盘聚焦可打开费用、用量及模型明细。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/ui.js:641-710"]}
{"unit_id":"dshworks__dsh-meter#feature-3","repo":"dshworks/dsh-meter","commit":"7865bd6533d2703b0d9b46c57aee3c339d4b121e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-meter 的功能「账户余额与计价币种」：打开明细卡片或 Meter 设置页时，主机按需读取 DeepSeek 账户余额，并据已充值余额选择账户使用的币种；结果经过 TTL 缓存。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:119-157","lib/balance.js:48-115"]}
{"unit_id":"dshworks__dsh-meter#feature-4","repo":"dshworks/dsh-meter","commit":"7865bd6533d2703b0d9b46c57aee3c339d4b121e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-meter 的功能「峰谷日历与省费提示」：Meter 设置页展示当前费率、每周费率时段和价目表；启用 saving mode 后，在系统提示中加入当前时段的可配置建议。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/ui.js:905-999","lib/index.js:101-116","lib/core.js:482-488"]}
{"unit_id":"dshworks__dsh-meter#caveat-1","repo":"dshworks/dsh-meter","commit":"7865bd6533d2703b0d9b46c57aee3c339d4b121e","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-meter 的余额明细会由主机向配置的 DeepSeek API 地址发送带 Bearer API key 的余额请求；不开启余额读取时不会请求该接口，密钥不会传到浏览器。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:121-157","lib/balance.js:70-95","src/ui.js:28-32"]}
{"unit_id":"dshworks__dsh-meter#caveat-2","repo":"dshworks/dsh-meter","commit":"7865bd6533d2703b0d9b46c57aee3c339d4b121e","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-meter 的费用是依据会话上报 token 和内置公开费率计算的估算值；未识别费率的模型会标记为未计价，实际账单可能不同。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/core.js:9-14","lib/core.js:817-820","lib/core.js:842"]}
